menu "Shahbaz safety supervision"

config SHAHBAZ_HEARTBEAT_TIMEOUT_MS
    int "Valid heartbeat timeout in milliseconds"
    default 0
    range 0 60000
    help
        Zero is the fail-closed default: communication health expires
        immediately. Select a nonzero value only after the host heartbeat
        period and measured scheduling/USB latency have been reviewed.

config SHAHBAZ_CONTROL_COMMAND_TIMEOUT_MS
    int "Valid actuator command timeout in milliseconds"
    default 0
    range 0 1000
    help
        Zero is the fail-closed default. Select a nonzero value only after
        flight-controller loop timing and end-to-end USB latency have been
        reviewed. This timeout is independent of host heartbeat traffic.

endmenu

